{
  "_comment": "The record of every app API version and every break. Read by the store server (to explain why an app does not run), by appsdk/tools/cpapp.py (to check an app's imports against the API it claims) and by host-tests/appstore/check_api.py (which fails when this, the SDK header and the firmware's import table disagree). Edit it with every API change; see docs/app-api/README.md.",
  "current": "1.0",
  "compatibleFrom": "1.0",
  "versions": [
    {
      "version": "1.0",
      "date": "2026-10-11",
      "compatibleFrom": "1.0",
      "breaking": false,
      "notes": "The first app API. Drawing mirrors FreeInkUI's DrawTarget (fill, stroke, line, triangle, text, bitmap, clip, text measurement) with fonts chosen by role; input arrives as events (back, tap, button, swipe, timer, resume, shown); each app gets a private folder of small files with a quota; plus the clock, a random source and a log. No network, radio or sensors.",
